  <name>BaseLens</name>
  <summary>See into every database</summary>
  <description>
    <p>BaseLens is a free, private desktop editor for SQLite, PostgreSQL and MySQL.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>One navigator for every connection and database</li>
      <li>Filters without writing SQL, value suggestions in WHERE</li>
      <li>Smart autocomplete, formatting and a command palette</li>
      <li>JSON viewer, charts and an ER diagram</li>
      <li>Optional AI assistant: local (Ollama) or cloud</li>
      <li>Passwords encrypted on your computer</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
